  m_Name: Lamprey
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: OneMoreKnight::OneMoreKnight.Enemies.EnemyStats
  maxHealth: 6
  moveSpeed: 1
  scoreValue: 350
  contactDamage: 1
  description: A mouth arranged in a spiral, going nowhere, arriving anyway. What
    it fires remembers where you were and resents where you are.
  tactics: Its slow red bolt hunts for over TWO seconds - you cannot simply sidestep
    it once. Drag it in a wide circle until it dies of old age, and mind the wave
    around you while you babysit it. Kill the Lamprey first when possible.
